1
00:00:10,520 --> 00:00:12,160
[Those who believe in the supremacy of money]

2
00:00:12,520 --> 00:00:14,160
[will eventually become hungry wolves.]

3
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:17,200
[When they greedily tear apart their own kind,]

4
00:00:18,320 --> 00:00:21,240
[they forget that they were once humans who walked on two legs.]

5
00:00:22,640 --> 00:00:24,520
[The brighter the glory of a wealthy family,]

6
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:28,920
[the deeper the shadow on the other side.]

7
00:01:35,320 --> 00:01:36,880
[The rose you crowned me with]

8
00:01:36,880 --> 00:01:38,520
[has long withered into a thorn.]

9
00:01:40,400 --> 00:01:42,080
[I planted thorns in the ruins]

10
00:01:42,520 --> 00:01:43,360
[where you burned me to ashes.]

11
00:01:43,360 --> 00:01:44,360
[The trending topic is blowing up.]

12
00:01:44,360 --> 00:01:46,640
[The rich family's son-in-law cheated on his brother's fiancée.]

13
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:48,840
[Even TV dramas wouldn't dare to film this plot.]

14
00:01:49,120 --> 00:01:50,600
[The Golden Silk Group's]

15
00:01:50,680 --> 00:01:52,960
[Dark Fairy Tale series fashion show is approaching.]

16
00:01:53,280 --> 00:01:54,640
[But the controlling family, the Lu family,]

17
00:01:54,640 --> 00:01:56,840
[has just revealed such a shocking scandal.]

18
00:01:56,960 --> 00:01:58,720
[Aren't the Lu couple very much in love?]

19
00:01:58,920 --> 00:02:00,240
[How did their image collapse so suddenly?]

20
00:02:00,240 --> 00:02:00,800
[He must have fallen for someone else.]

21
00:02:00,800 --> 00:02:01,840
[And it's his brother's fiancée.]

22
00:02:01,840 --> 00:02:03,360
[Cheaters, just get a divorce!]

23
00:02:03,760 --> 00:02:04,480
[Tonight,]

24
00:02:06,160 --> 00:02:08,360
[they will climb your sturdy castle,]

25
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:10,480
[and carve your sins]

26
00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:13,480
[on every stone brick.]

27
00:02:14,640 --> 00:02:15,440
Shen Jingmo,

28
00:02:17,160 --> 00:02:18,000
why are you here?

29
00:02:19,280 --> 00:02:20,840
I knew you would choose to face everything.

30
00:02:23,960 --> 00:02:24,720
Put it on.

31
00:02:25,120 --> 00:02:25,920
At least it will protect you

32
00:02:26,360 --> 00:02:28,200
from those hurtful words.

33
00:02:31,160 --> 00:02:32,000
Focus on your live broadcast.

34
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:36,320
I'll handle the rest.

35
00:02:42,400 --> 00:02:43,800
The trending topic you see

36
00:02:44,600 --> 00:02:46,840
is stirring up a storm that threatens to engulf me.

37
00:02:48,480 --> 00:02:48,760
Look,

38
00:02:48,800 --> 00:02:50,400
that mistress from the news is going live!

39
00:02:50,640 --> 00:02:53,240
And at the eye of this storm, the woman dubbed despicable

40
00:02:53,840 --> 00:02:55,520
stands right before you.

41
00:02:55,680 --> 00:02:56,400
That's right,

42
00:02:56,600 --> 00:02:57,920
I'm the woman in the news.

43
00:02:59,280 --> 00:03:01,000
Now, I want to share with you

44
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:02,560
everything I've been through and the truth.

45
00:03:03,720 --> 00:03:05,120
Where should I start?

46
00:03:09,960 --> 00:03:12,400
Let's start from the time I met him in France.

47
00:03:28,240 --> 00:03:29,160
14 to 13.

48
00:03:40,320 --> 00:03:41,240
14 to 14.

49
00:03:43,720 --> 00:03:44,440
The final sword.

50
00:03:56,200 --> 00:03:56,640
Ah.

51
00:03:56,640 --> 00:03:57,320
Be careful.

52
00:04:18,040 --> 00:04:18,840
Are you okay?

53
00:04:23,960 --> 00:04:25,200
15 to 14.

54
00:04:25,760 --> 00:04:26,600
You lost.

55
00:04:41,840 --> 00:04:42,320
Have some water.

56
00:04:44,080 --> 00:04:45,680
How did you find this fencing club?

57
00:04:46,160 --> 00:04:48,000
And how do you know I've never lost here?

58
00:04:51,960 --> 00:04:52,960
I'm here on a business trip.

59
00:04:53,680 --> 00:04:54,680
I heard that

60
00:04:55,080 --> 00:04:57,160
there's a very skilled female fencer here.

61
00:04:58,400 --> 00:04:59,960
I lost convincingly today.

62
00:05:00,480 --> 00:05:01,360
Fencing is an art,

63
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:02,400
not just a sport.

64
00:05:03,080 --> 00:05:04,000
But it's also a happy thing

65
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:05,640
to meet you.

66
00:05:06,680 --> 00:05:07,640
What's your name?

67
00:05:10,640 --> 00:05:11,520
Your left hand.

68
00:05:34,320 --> 00:05:35,440
This is my name.

69
00:05:35,720 --> 00:05:37,280
It depends on whether you can guess it.

70
00:05:40,320 --> 00:05:41,040
Jiang Li.

71
00:05:50,680 --> 00:05:51,680
Do you have time in the evening?

72
00:05:52,040 --> 00:05:52,800
I'll treat you to a meal.

73
00:05:55,080 --> 00:05:55,880
Just a meal?

74
00:05:58,160 --> 00:05:58,920
Just a meal.

75
00:06:03,120 --> 00:06:05,440
Staying in a huge villa for just two days.

76
00:06:05,880 --> 00:06:08,040
you rich folks really live it up.

77
00:06:12,520 --> 00:06:14,000
Provençal blood (wine).

78
00:06:14,360 --> 00:06:15,800
Did you specifically ask the hotel to prepare this?

79
00:06:51,280 --> 00:06:52,640
A ring mark on the ring finger.

80
00:06:53,160 --> 00:06:54,160
Are you married?

81
00:07:00,480 --> 00:07:01,400
Do you care?

82
00:08:03,160 --> 00:08:03,880
Ma'am,

83
00:08:03,960 --> 00:08:05,080
this is the place.

84
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:41,920
Someone's coming in.

85
00:08:51,560 --> 00:08:52,240
I'll go check.

86
00:09:11,560 --> 00:09:12,360
Honey.

87
00:09:21,080 --> 00:09:22,200
Why are you in France?

88
00:09:33,800 --> 00:09:35,400
The wine of Provence.

89
00:09:38,080 --> 00:09:39,240
The hotel gave it to us.

90
00:09:39,600 --> 00:09:40,680
I accidentally

91
00:09:40,760 --> 00:09:41,680
spilled it.

92
00:09:42,040 --> 00:09:43,040
I haven't cleaned it up yet.

93
00:09:44,280 --> 00:09:45,200
Hmm.

94
00:09:54,320 --> 00:09:54,840
Honey.

95
00:09:58,960 --> 00:09:59,360
Yes?

96
00:09:59,520 --> 00:10:00,000
Honey.

97
00:10:16,800 --> 00:10:18,240
What a pretty bracelet.

98
00:10:32,640 --> 00:10:34,000
I saw it at the mall.

99
00:10:36,560 --> 00:10:37,440
I thought

100
00:10:38,200 --> 00:10:38,760
it suits you well.

101
00:10:44,720 --> 00:10:45,960
Thank you, honey.

102
00:10:47,080 --> 00:10:47,760
Guess

103
00:10:48,080 --> 00:10:49,520
why I came to France.

104
00:10:52,760 --> 00:10:53,280
Yeah.

105
00:10:53,880 --> 00:10:54,680
Why didn't you

106
00:10:55,200 --> 00:10:56,320
tell me in advance?

107
00:10:57,160 --> 00:10:58,080
I'm here

108
00:10:58,160 --> 00:10:59,160
to discuss with my mom

109
00:10:59,160 --> 00:11:00,720
about holding a proper wedding ceremony.

110
00:11:03,320 --> 00:11:04,280
We've been

111
00:11:04,280 --> 00:11:05,240
married for so long,

112
00:11:06,120 --> 00:11:07,720
and Mumu is already five years old.

113
00:11:08,280 --> 00:11:09,040
Chairman,

114
00:11:09,160 --> 00:11:09,880
will she agree?

115
00:11:10,160 --> 00:11:11,160
My mom agreed.

116
00:11:12,040 --> 00:11:12,960
Although

117
00:11:12,960 --> 00:11:14,240
she just had surgery,

118
00:11:14,240 --> 00:11:15,560
and is recuperating in France.

119
00:11:15,560 --> 00:11:16,840
She can't attend the ceremony.

120
00:11:17,120 --> 00:11:17,960
But she said

121
00:11:18,480 --> 00:11:19,800
during this period,

122
00:11:20,160 --> 00:11:22,920
you will be the temporary head of Golden Silks.

123
00:11:24,760 --> 00:11:25,160
Really?

124
00:11:25,280 --> 00:11:25,560
Yes.

125
00:11:31,800 --> 00:11:32,960
Are you happy?

126
00:11:33,080 --> 00:11:35,000
I finally got my mom's approval.

127
00:11:36,600 --> 00:11:37,040
Alright.

128
00:11:37,560 --> 00:11:38,680
I'll go change into my pajamas.

129
00:11:42,640 --> 00:11:43,240
Honey.

130
00:11:43,440 --> 00:11:44,240
That's great.

131
00:11:44,600 --> 00:11:45,560
I really love you so much.

132
00:11:46,320 --> 00:11:47,120
Honey.

133
00:11:47,280 --> 00:11:48,400
But you're holding me too tightly.

134
00:11:48,400 --> 00:11:50,120
I can hardly breathe.

135
00:12:18,760 --> 00:12:20,440
Guess who called?

136
00:12:23,200 --> 00:12:24,000
Zhou Jian.

137
00:12:24,200 --> 00:12:25,600
I know you're watching the live broadcast.

138
00:12:26,400 --> 00:12:28,360
[Why did you call me from an unfamiliar number?]

139
00:12:29,160 --> 00:12:29,960
[Are you feeling guilty?]

140
00:12:30,200 --> 00:12:31,080
[Or are you afraid?]

141
00:12:32,200 --> 00:12:34,280
[You thought you could control the game of fate.]

142
00:12:34,960 --> 00:12:35,760
[How ridiculous.]

143
00:12:37,480 --> 00:12:39,840
[I'm the one who truly controls everything.]

144
00:12:42,960 --> 00:12:44,200
Where were we?

145
00:12:45,920 --> 00:12:47,200
Oh, I remember now.

146
00:12:48,680 --> 00:12:49,960
Jiang Li.

147
00:12:51,120 --> 00:12:53,440
We met again a month later,

148
00:12:54,320 --> 00:12:57,040
at the new collection launch of Golden Silks.

149
00:13:04,600 --> 00:13:05,760
[I know many people]

150
00:13:05,960 --> 00:13:07,640
[would call me a mistress,]

151
00:13:09,400 --> 00:13:11,640
[and judge me as a heartless woman.]

152
00:13:14,640 --> 00:13:18,120
[But I'm a human being.]

153
00:13:18,480 --> 00:13:20,800
[Who cares about the truth?]

154
00:13:23,240 --> 00:13:24,680
[I didn't do it for money,]

155
00:13:25,520 --> 00:13:26,840
[or for fun.]

156
00:13:28,240 --> 00:13:29,560
[I knew very well]

157
00:13:29,760 --> 00:13:30,680
[he had a family,]

158
00:13:30,920 --> 00:13:31,840
[a wife,]

159
00:13:32,120 --> 00:13:33,120
[and a child.]

160
00:13:49,040 --> 00:13:51,480
So you must be curious why I did this, right?

161
00:13:53,560 --> 00:13:55,720
Now let me reveal the answer.

162
00:14:23,520 --> 00:14:24,760
I want them

163
00:14:25,520 --> 00:14:25,880
all

164
00:14:26,040 --> 00:14:26,920
to die.
